### Sentinel — API Examples
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080

## ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
## Predictions
## ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Get ranked predictions for a specific week
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/predictions/2025-W03
Accept: application/json

### Get predictions with query parameters (future: filtering, pagination)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/predictions/2025-W03?limit=10
Accept: application/json

## ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
## Explainability
## ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Explain why a specific gateway was ranked for a given week
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/predictions/2025-W03/GW-12345/explain
Accept: application/json

## ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
## Re-run
## ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Re-run ranking for a specific week (recalculates from source data)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/predictions/2025-W03/rerun
Accept: application/json

## ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
## Health & Info
## ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

### Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
Accept: application/json

### Application info
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/info
Accept: application/json

### OpenAPI specification
GET http://localhost:8080/v3/api-docs
Accept: application/json

###
# NOTE: These endpoints are placeholders.
# They will return errors until implemented in Phase 2+.
